US resuming full-scale operations against Iran for the first time in almost two months.\n\nThe president said on 
Friday that the US military had carried out new limited strikes against Iran, targeting an Iranian air defence system, 
describing the action to reporters as \"minor\".\n\nThat same day, he discussed efforts to de-escalate tensions in the 
